Feed: stop weaving mint-announcement posts into the feed

Mint rows (card_kind='handle_mint') cluttered the For You feed, and a
stale one could keep landing at the top. Remove the span-mint fetch and
weave from getFeedPage entirely; mints still live full-size on the
@proofofwriting profile, thread pages, and quote embeds. The digest/weave
helpers stay dormant (called with empty data, no-op) for easy re-enable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
